  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Andes Culture of Encounter: Partner Exchanges and Collaborations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen collaboration and mutual learning among partner organisations in the Andes and wider Latin America. Through exchanges, joint learning, and experience-sharing on themes chosen by partners, it will nurture a Culture of Encounter that promotes solidarity and collective action. Activities will focus on key thematic areas including socio-environmental justice and extractivism, resilience and sustainable livelihoods, emergency preparedness and response, and governance, peacebuilding and gender justice. The project will create spaces for partners to share knowledge, build relationships, and develop common strategies to address shared challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
